+<!-- Permanent (not focus-only) muted circle behind top_bar_account, so it
+     reads as a filled avatar chip like the reference's account photo
+     rather than a bare outline icon floating loose in the pill; user
+     flagged the bare-icon version as looking "tách hẳn ra" (detached) from
+     the button group even though it was already inside the same
+     top_bar_group_background pill. This sits underneath the focus-state
