+          where the title sits). A single continuous image, not a sharp
+          hero-only image layered separately from a blurred full-screen
+          one, that produced a hard visible seam between the two,
+          confirmed wrong on-device. See hero_banner.xml, which now only
+          positions text over this, no image of its own.
+       2. hero_banner.xml : title/subtitle text positioning.
